/.*.md

# Test reports
vitest-junit.xml
shadowlap-junit.xml
coverage/

# What scripts/dashboard-video.mjs renders (the dashboard tour); the README's pictures go to .github/assets/readme/
scripts/out/

# Sample exports for eyeballing
/.*.html

# Agent worktrees
/.worktrees/
